  "answer": "This feature request has been filed before. PowerToys#19041 is the main tracking issue for customizable mouse gestures. PowerToys#30856 was closed as a duplicate of it, and it also cites MouseInc. PowerToys has no built-in mouse gesture feature yet, and the maintainers have not said when or whether it will be added. Please add your use case (right-button gestures, app-specific profiles, actions such as Back, Forward and Close) as a comment or 👍 on #19041 instead of opening a new request. In the meantime, you can keep using MouseInc, StrokesPlus or the AutoHotkey script MouseGestureL, which were suggested in those tickets."
